<tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" filename="基本表計算のデータボックス">
<document>
<p>基本表計算のデータボックス</p>
<p>基本表計算の検索/置換、用紙設定、閉じるときに保存を尋ねるパネル、できなかったことを知らせるパネル、操作パネル(パネル6)の定義。操作パネルの押しボタンの文字、色、入力欄の文字は基本表計算が書き換える。罫線とグラフの押しボタンの絵はレコード0の資源0〜10(PNG)。</p>
</document>
<databox>
<panel num="2" rect="0,0,420,196" title="検索/置換">
<text x="16" y="40">検索：</text>
<box num="11" rect="80,20,404,50" max="200" jp="true"/>
<text x="16" y="80">置換：</text>
<box num="12" rect="80,60,404,90" max="200" jp="true"/>
<switch num="13" rect="80,98,300,122">正規表現</switch>
<text num="14" x="16" y="146"> </text>
<button num="101" rect="16,158,104,184" emph="true">次を検索</button>
<button num="102" rect="110,158,178,184">置換</button>
<button num="103" rect="184,158,284,184">すべて置換</button>
<button num="104" rect="316,158,404,184" answer="cancel">閉じる</button>
</panel>
<panel num="3" rect="0,0,380,232" title="用紙設定">
<text x="16" y="40">用紙：</text>
<select num="11" rect="88,20,364,54" across="true" value="2"><name>A3</name><name>A4</name><name>A5</name><name>B4</name><name>B5</name><name>レター</name></select>
<text x="16" y="82">向き：</text>
<select num="12" rect="88,62,232,96" across="true" value="1"><name>縦</name><name>横</name></select>
<text x="16" y="124">余白(mm)　上</text>
<serial num="13" rect="132,104,188,134"><f w="3" lo="0" hi="200" value="20"/></serial>
<text x="200" y="124">下</text>
<serial num="14" rect="222,104,278,134"><f w="3" lo="0" hi="200" value="20"/></serial>
<text x="96" y="164">左</text>
<serial num="15" rect="132,144,188,174"><f w="3" lo="0" hi="200" value="20"/></serial>
<text x="200" y="164">右</text>
<serial num="16" rect="222,144,278,174"><f w="3" lo="0" hi="200" value="20"/></serial>
<button num="101" rect="180,194,268,220" answer="cancel">取消</button>
<button num="102" rect="276,194,364,220" answer="ok" emph="true">設定</button>
</panel>
<panel num="4" rect="0,0,340,112" title="基本表計算">
<text x="20" y="40">変更を保存してから閉じますか？</text>
<button num="101" rect="16,72,92,98" answer="cancel">取消</button>
<button num="103" rect="100,72,212,98">保存しない</button>
<button num="102" rect="220,72,324,98" emph="true">保存</button>
</panel>
<panel num="5" rect="0,0,440,128" title="基本表計算">
<text num="1" x="24" y="40"> </text>
<text num="2" x="24" y="62"> </text>
<button num="101" rect="328,88,416,114" answer="ok" emph="true">了解</button>
</panel>
<panel num="6" rect="0,0,600,84" title="操作パネル" kind="bare">
<button num="11" rect="6,4,78,26">ゴシック▼</button>
<button num="12" rect="82,4,122,26">12 ▼</button>
<switch num="13" rect="126,4,160,26">B</switch>
<switch num="14" rect="162,4,196,26">I</switch>
<switch num="15" rect="198,4,232,26">U</switch>
<switch num="16" rect="234,4,268,26">S</switch>
<switch num="17" rect="270,4,324,26">上付</switch>
<switch num="18" rect="326,4,380,26">下付</switch>
<button num="19" rect="384,4,432,26">文字色</button>
<swatch num="20" rect="434,6,450,24" off="true"/>
<button num="21" rect="454,4,504,26">地の色</button>
<swatch num="22" rect="506,6,522,24" off="true"/>
<button num="23" rect="526,4,562,26">左 ▼</button>
<button num="24" rect="564,4,600,26">中 ▼</button>
<line rect="0,29,600,30"/>
<button num="31" rect="6,31,30,53" pict="0_0.png">格子</button>
<button num="32" rect="34,31,58,53" pict="0_1.png">外枠</button>
<button num="33" rect="62,31,86,53" pict="0_2.png">上</button>
<button num="34" rect="90,31,114,53" pict="0_3.png">下</button>
<button num="35" rect="118,31,142,53" pict="0_4.png">左</button>
<button num="36" rect="146,31,170,53" pict="0_5.png">右</button>
<button num="37" rect="174,31,198,53" pict="0_6.png">なし</button>
<button num="38" rect="204,31,254,53">線の色</button>
<swatch num="39" rect="256,33,272,51" off="true"/>
<button num="40" rect="278,31,336,53">実線 ▼</button>
<button num="41" rect="340,31,386,53">細 ▼</button>
<button num="42" rect="394,30,422,54" pict="0_7.png">集合縦棒</button>
<button num="43" rect="426,30,454,54" pict="0_8.png">積上縦棒</button>
<button num="44" rect="458,30,486,54" pict="0_9.png">折れ線</button>
<button num="45" rect="490,30,518,54" pict="0_10.png">積上折線</button>
<line rect="0,56,600,57"/>
<text num="51" x="8" y="76"> </text>
<button num="52" rect="62,59,90,81">fx</button>
<box num="53" rect="94,59,536,81" jp="true"></box>
<button num="54" rect="540,59,568,81">✓</button>
<button num="55" rect="572,59,600,81">×</button>
</panel>
</databox>
</tad>
